annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{m rSup { size 8{3} } } {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>) is occupied by 1 mol of gas? (c) If this volume is a cube, what is the length of its sides in kilometers?</p></div>
</div>

    </section></div>
